{
  "title": "瑞幸官宣新联名猫咪，周边竟然是垃圾袋！网友：瑞幸的联名真是神一阵鬼一阵的",
  "source_name": "",
  "byline": "餐饮实纪",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "k": "txt",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "txt",
          "text": "因为瑞幸与《王焕君和张缤智》漫画联名，从上周一开始挨全网骂，一直骂到现在，日子太难过太漫长；"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "k": "txt",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "txt",
          "text": "为了早日结束“挨骂”的日子，瑞幸在8月19日宣布，"
        },
        {
          "type": "txt",
          "text": "下一期新联名“MIND.A.DAY”将于8月22日上线。",
          "bold": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "k": "img",
      "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/A7MGEVaSt8LT0S1aPvvn6VVU7KxqxKZvIvaKlLOlAmHVdabiaBL50oZpXjzfguicjgfJwUgvQdanSlXxBgMFlHzjROBbLTqxDnXXicZDUmMWvI/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg",
      "dataW": "694",
      "dataRatio": "1.3227665706051874"
    },
    {
      "k": "cap",
      "text": "图片来源：小红书@瑞幸咖啡"
    },
    {
      "k": "txt",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "txt",
          "text": "近两年，瑞幸单个联名主题至少持续一周，多则两周；"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "k": "txt",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "txt",
          "text": "《王张》联名只活了短短5天就被换掉了，这难道不是“瑞幸史上最短命联名”吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "k": "txt",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "txt",
          "text": "“迪士尼反派联名”在上线前5天官方宣发，也仅仅是“浅浅露个脸”，有效的联名信息都没有放，神秘十足。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "k": "img",
      "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/A7MGEVaSt8LFSWFDEQ7yLE2UZuGL0Ekvgj2obS3Iw18JD1o4fSBYujOWjhQe0yGrzTbpCH0Cv02qYGKv74qyQNMkjEibvVlB6o6OLLczBhJM/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg",
      "dataW": "675",
      "dataRatio": "1.2740740740740741"
    },
    {
      "k": "cap",
      "text": "图片来源：小红书@瑞幸咖啡"
    },
    {
      "k": "txt",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "txt",
          "text": "这次为了挽回局面，提前5天，瑞幸被逼得“什么都招了”，“MIND.A.DAY ”的包材、周边、套餐组合全部在官号上展示得一清二楚！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "k": "txt",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "txt",
          "text": "联名一共分两波，第一波在22日，第二波在31日，持续两周。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "k": "img",
      "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/A7MGEVaSt8I9ciaHtMm3MjABFOBNgP0QPnE5UtD8Zic5icAeXuV2B4vemqIgk1junwzYIY4DyibPYH0hRMviahhuPhqhiayyMdeWNqNDwdPqicJxjk/640?wx_fmt=gif",
